@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@postingUrl = https://careers.example.com/jobs/{{$uuid}}
@role = Backend

### 문항이 없는 공고·직무 (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{postingUrl}}","role":"{{role}}"}

?? status == 204

### 최초 문항 등록 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url":"{{postingUrl}}",
  "role":"{{role}}",
  "questions":[{"prompt":"지원 동기를 알려 주세요.","limit":null},{"prompt":"협업 경험을 알려 주세요.","limit":800}]
}

?? status == 201

### 후속 등록은 먼저 저장된 세트를 보존 (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{postingUrl}}","role":"{{role}}","questions":[{"prompt":"다른 문항","limit":500}]}

?? status == 204

### 다음 사용자가 같은 공고와 직무의 문항을 확인 (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{postingUrl}}?utm_source=newsletter","role":"backend"}

?? status == 200
?? body questions[0].prompt == 지원 동기를 알려 주세요.
?? body questions[1].limit == 800

> {% client.global.set("sharedQuestionSetId", response.body.id) %}

### 같은 공고의 다른 직무 (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{postingUrl}}","role":"Frontend"}

?? status == 204

### 본 문항 버전에 정정 내용 제보 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/{{sharedQuestionSetId}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"questions":[{"prompt":"지원 동기와 입사 후 목표를 알려 주세요.","limit":700}]}

?? status == 201

### 존재하지 않는 문항에 제보 (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{}

?? status == 404
?? body error == POSTING_QUESTIONS_NOT_FOUND

### 상세 공고 주소 누락 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://careers.example.com/","role":"{{role}}"}

?? status == 400
?? body error == INVALID_POSTING_URL

### 빈 문항 저장 거절 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/postings/shared-questions
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"{{postingUrl}}","role":"{{role}}","questions":[{"prompt":" ","limit":800}]}

?? status == 400
?? body error == INVALID_REQUEST
